==Battleground==
*200 [[Those Guys]] spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 13.33~40 seconds<sup>400f~1,200f</sup>.
*100 [[Snache]]s spawn after 10.67 seconds<sup>320f</sup>, delay 13.33~40 seconds<sup>400f~1,200f</sup>.
*5 [[Baa Baa]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 0.07~4 seconds<sup>2f~120f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 2~6 seconds<sup>60f~180f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 60% HP:
**1 [[Sir Seal]] spawns as the boss.
**15 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 0.07~4 seconds<sup>2f~120f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

==Trivia==
*Like all [[Never Summer! (Monthly Event)|Never Summer!]] stages, Glutton Next Door's Japanese name references a song; in this case, it is quite literally "[https://youtu.be/_46q__aRHAA Taiyō no Komachi Angel]" by [[wikipedia:B'z|B'z]].
**It is the only Never Summer! stage to share a name with its reference rather than being a pun.

